title: Advisors
subtitle: The three posts in the Zentrale.
new-page: true

= Advisors

The party's three posts.

- @rf_hand: Back.

@org
title: Organisation
subtitle: Your organisation secretary. Can act once every six months.
is-pinned-card: true
tags: rf_advisor
new-page: true
on-arrival: {! window.RF.advisorView(Q, 'org'); !}

= Organisation

[+ adv_text +]

- @org_recruit
- @org_apparatus
- @rf_appoint_org
- @rf_hand: Back.

@org_recruit
title: Recruitment drive.
subtitle: More members. Costs 1 resource.
view-if: adv_ready = 1
new-page: true
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 1 resource.
on-arrival: {!
Q.members += 10;
Q.funds -= 1;
window.RF.advisorUse(Q, 'org');
!}

Factory meetings, leaflets at the labour exchanges and a membership week in every district bring in new members.

- @rf_hand: Back to the party.

@org_apparatus
title: Tighten the apparatus.
subtitle: More paid functionaries loyal to the leadership; the leadership's faction calms down.
view-if: adv_ready = 1
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.apparatus += 6;
Q[Q.leader + '_dissent'] -= 4;
window.RF.advisorUse(Q, 'org');
!}

District secretaries are checked, paid on time and reminded who appointed them.

- @rf_hand: Back to the party.

@rf_appoint_org
title: Appoint a new head of organisation.
subtitle: The old holder's faction is angered and the new one's pleased. The six-month wait stays.
new-page: true
on-arrival: {! window.RF.advisorCandidates(Q, 'org'); !}

= Organisation

The post is held by [+ adv_current +]. Who should take it over?

- @pick_eberlein
- @pick_pieck
- @pick_geschke
- @pick_scholem
- @rf_hand: Keep things as they are.

