= Trade Unions

[+ adv_text +]

- @unions_councils
- @unions_adgb
- @rf_appoint_unions
- @rf_hand: Back.

@unions_councils
title: Campaign in the factory councils.
subtitle: More Communist influence in the workplaces. The <span class="p-spd">SPD</span> resents it.
view-if: adv_ready = 1
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.union_influence += 6;
Q.spd_relation -= 3;
window.RF.advisorUse(Q, 'unions');
!}

Communist slates stand in the factory-council elections and win seats in the big works.

- @rf_hand: Back to the party.

@unions_adgb
title: Work inside the ADGB unions.
subtitle: Some union influence and better relations with the <span class="p-spd">SPD</span>.
view-if: adv_ready = 1
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.union_influence += 3;
Q.spd_relation += 4;
window.RF.advisorUse(Q, 'unions');
!}

Communists stay in the Free Trade Unions, take on the dull work of the locals and avoid open splits.

- @rf_hand: Back to the party.

@rf_appoint_unions
title: Appoint a new head of trade-union work.
subtitle: The old holder's faction is angered and the new one's pleased. The six-month wait stays.
new-page: true
on-arrival: {! window.RF.advisorCandidates(Q, 'unions'); !}

