= Military Affairs

[+ adv_text +]

- @military_arm
- @military_lie_low
- @rf_appoint_military
- @rf_hand: Back.

@military_arm
title: Arm and train the defence units.
subtitle: More readiness for a rising. Draws the police. Costs 1 resource.
view-if: adv_ready = 1
new-page: true
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 1 resource.
on-arrival: {!
Q.readiness += 6;
Q.repression += 3;
Q.funds -= 1;
window.RF.advisorUse(Q, 'military');
!}

Weapons are bought, hidden and cleaned; men drill on Sundays in the woods outside the cities.

- @rf_hand: Back to the party.

@military_lie_low
title: Lie low and protect the cadres.
subtitle: Less state repression.
view-if: adv_ready = 1
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.repression -= 5;
window.RF.advisorUse(Q, 'military');
!}

Lists are burned, weapons buried and known militants moved to other towns.

- @rf_hand: Back to the party.

@rf_appoint_military
title: Appoint a new head of military affairs.
subtitle: The old holder's faction is angered and the new one's pleased. The six-month wait stays.
new-page: true
on-arrival: {! window.RF.advisorCandidates(Q, 'military'); !}

